@startuml
actor Operador
participant "Git submodule" as Git
participant "Docker Compose root" as Compose
participant "golang-simulador/compose.yaml" as G
Operador -> Git : update --init --recursive
Git --> Operador : checkout submódulos
Operador -> Compose : docker compose config
Compose -> G : include ./golang-simulator/compose.yaml
note right of G
Inconsistência entre path real
do submódulo e include.
end note
@enduml
